  1495	 \begin{proposition}\label{cor WlogSpare}
  1496	For a quasi-order $Q$ the following are equivalent.
  1497	\begin{enumThm}
  1498	\item $Q$ is a better-quasi-order,
  1499	\item there is no bad super-sequence in $Q$,
  1500	\item there is no bad spare super-sequence in $Q$.
